      "text": "Classifier Metrics Playground\nN · π · TPR · FPR → live\nTry: TPR=90%, FPR=5%, π=1% → watch Precision collapse.\n⠇ Edit Layout\n↺ Reset\nGrab ⠇ on any panel to reorder\nPARAMETERS\nDataset size (N)\nLog · 100 → 500k\nPrevalence (π)\n% positives\nTPR (Sensitivity)\nTrue Positive Rate\nFPR (1−Spec)\nFalse Positive Rate\nLIVE EQUATIONS\nCOUNTS\nN (Total)\n5,030\nTP+FN+FP+TN\nP (Actual)\n1,506\nP=TP+FN\nNeg (Actual)\n3,524\nNeg=TN+FP\nPred+ (Predict+)\n2,110\nPred+=TP+FP\nPred- (Predict-)\n2,920\nPred-=TN+FN\nRATES\nTPR (Recall)\n70.06%\nTP/P=TP/(TP+FN)\nFNR (Miss)\n29.94%\nFN/P=FN/(TP+FN)\nTNR (Specificity)\n70.06%\nTN/Neg=TN/(TN+FP)\nFPR (Fallout)\n29.94%\nFP/Neg=FP/(TN+FP)\nSCORES\nPrec (Precission)\n50.00%\nTP/Pred+=TP/(TP+FP)\nNPV (Neg. Pred. Value)\n84.56%\nTN/Pred-=TN/(TN+FN)\nAcc (Accuracy)\n70.06%\n(TP+TN)/N = (TP+TN)/5,030\nF1 (Balance)\n58.35%\n2TP/(P+Pred+) = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)\nBAcc (Balanced)\n70.06%\n½×(TP/P + TN/Neg)\nCONFUSION MATRIX\nTN 2,469\nFP 1,055\nFN 451\nTP 1,055\nActual Neg\nActual Pos\nP=1,506 N=3,524 | TP=1,055 FP=1,055 TN=2,469 FN=451\nTP\nFN\nFP\nTN\nPrediction\nDERIVED METRICS\nPRECISION\n50.0%\nF1\n58.4%\nACCURACY\n70.1%\nBAL ACC\n70.1%\nTNR\n70.1%\nNPV\n84.6%\nPRESETS\nBalanced\nπ=50%\nImbalanced\nπ=10%\nV. Imbalanced\nπ=1%\nPerfect\nTPR≈100 FPR≈0\nRandom\nTPR=FPR\nReset\ndefaults\nCOUNTS\n1,055\n1,055\n2,469\n451\n2,110\n2,920\nTP\nFP\nTN\nFN\nPred+\nPred-\n0\n1000\n2000\n3000\ncount\nRATES\n70.1\n29.9\n50.0\n70.1\n58.4\n70.1\n84.6\nTPR\nFPR\nPrec\nAcc\nF1\nBAcc\nNPV\n0\n50\n100\n%\nROC · ISO-LR⁺\n  LR⁺=2.3\n0\n0.5\n1\n0\n0.5\n1\nFPR\nTPR\nPRECISION-RECALL\n0\n0.5\n1\n0\n0.5\n1\nRecall\nPrecision",
